<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p data-start="222" data-end="288">Dear Centre of Excellence, <b>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Name__c}</b>,<br><br></p><p data-start="290" data-end="451">We are writing to inform you regarding the applications submitted under your Hub for the current review cycle of the Wadhwani Innovation Network Grant Program.<br><br></p><p data-start="453" data-end="658">After a thorough evaluation by our expert panel, the application titled “<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>” has not been shortlisted for presentation before the Selection Committee at this stage.<br><br><b>WIN Admin Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}<br><br></p><p data-start="660" data-end="974">We request you to kindly communicate this outcome to the respective Principal Investigators at your earliest convenience, along with the expert reviewer feedback, so that they may have the opportunity to reflect on and address the observations raised, should they wish to consider resubmission in a future round.<br><br></p><p data-start="976" data-end="1266">We sincerely appreciate the efforts of your Hub in identifying, supporting, and mentoring these applicants through the application process. The quality of proposals submitted reflects the dedication and commitment of your team, and we encourage you to continue nurturing these innovators.<br><br></p><p data-start="1268" data-end="1365">We will keep you informed of further updates regarding the ongoing review cycle and next steps.</p><p data-start="1367" data-end="1472">Should you have any questions or require any clarifications, please do not hesitate to reach out to us.<br><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">






</p><p data-start="1474" data-end="1512"><span data-start="1474" data-end="1488">Sincerely,</span><br data-start="1488" data-end="1491"><b>
Wadhwani Foundation</b></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>